{
  "id": "signage",
  "content": {
    "description": [
      [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "After OCAD repainted the Sharp Centre during my third-year winter break, the studio’s sign was misplaced. "
            },
            {
              "type": "external-link",
              "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jogindersinghphotography/",
              "label": "Joginder Singh"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": " treated that as a chance to replace it with signage aligned to the poster identity and versatile enough to serve as the Design Photography logo on walls, events, and communications at different scales."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "This tied environmental graphics to digital communications. I also developed labels for equipment and services so students could better navigate the studio’s resources."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    ],
